  "notes": "{流行|はや}る is an intransitive godan verb meaning something becomes popular or widespread.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive) - the subject spreads/becomes popular on its own.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{流行|はや}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means \"is currently popular/going around.\"\n\nPRONUNCIATION:\n- {流行|はや}る (verb): to be popular, to spread\n- ⟦{流行|りゅうこう}→流行：03678_ryuukou⟧ (noun): trend, fashion, epidemic\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. Positive: trends, fashion, songs, games\n2. Negative: diseases, epidemics ({流行|はや}り⟦{病|やまい}→病：13610_yamai⟧)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {流行|はや}り⟦{物|もの}→物：02259_mono⟧: something trendy\n- ⟦{流行|りゅうこう}{語|ご}→流行語：13307_ryuukougo⟧: buzzword, trendy word\n- ⟦{大流行|だいりゅうこう}→大流行：19965_dairyuukou⟧: huge trend, pandemic",
